# Read-only observation of the canonical MuJoCo bottle and gripper.
---
bool success
string message
builtin_interfaces/Time simulation_stamp
geometry_msgs/Pose bottle_pose
float64 gripper_width_m
uint32 bottle_contact_count
uint32 left_finger_contact_count
uint32 right_finger_contact_count
float64 max_bottle_contact_force_n
float64 max_bottle_penetration_m
